THE KERNEL
----------
The geometry kernel this crate wraps is OpenGeometry, from
github.com/OpenGeometry-io/OpenGeometry, used as a pinned git
dependency at commit 61c05b12790a534dbb3c7a8a94fd4f9d98ffac07.

  Copyright: OpenGeometry contributors (the kernel's license file
  names no individual holder; the kernel is maintained by the
  Ploterr team).
  License: Mozilla Public License 2.0.

The kernel is used unmodified, never vendored into this repository,
and never forked. If you build against this crate, Cargo fetches the
kernel from its own repository at the pinned commit; its license
travels with it.

FLOORKIT / PLOTERR
------------------
Floorkit is a proprietary product of Ploterr (per-hostname license
key, usage telemetry). No Floorkit code, SDK, or assets are used in
this repository. Floorkit appears in the documentation only as the
published proof that the kit-as-data pattern works in the wild; the
capability is emulated here, never licensed.

THE RECORD LAYER
----------------
The IMBUUID record layer this crate binds to is not part of this
repository. This repository holds the interface to the identity
layer — records named by opaque id, parameters across a seam — not
the identity layer itself.
